@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy";
    ViewData["MetaDescription"] = "How ApplyWise handles account details, resumes, applications, and connected Google data.";
}
<section class="public-info-card">
    <span class="eyebrow">Privacy policy</span>
    <h1>Your job search belongs to you.</h1>
    <p><strong>Last updated: August 26, 2026.</strong> This policy explains how the ApplyWise operator collects, uses, stores, and deletes information when you use ApplyWise.</p>
    <div class="public-info-grid">
        <div><h2>Information we collect</h2><p>Account and profile details, uploaded resumes, applications, interviews, analysis results, job-post checks, contact messages, security records, and basic product-usage events needed to operate and protect the service.</p></div>
        <div><h2>How it is used</h2><p>To provide your private workspace, analyze resumes, track applications, secure accounts, diagnose failures, prevent abuse, and improve product reliability. ApplyWise does not sell personal information.</p></div>
        <div><h2>Private files</h2><p>Uploaded resumes are stored outside the public web root. You can retrieve your files only after authentication and an ownership check. The owner console shows operational metadata and analysis results, but does not provide routine access to the contents of uploaded resumes. Core resume scores continue to use local, explainable rules.</p></div>
        <div><h2>AI-assisted ATS feedback</h2><p>When you request an ATS report, ApplyWise calculates the displayed score locally using explainable rules. It then sends the extracted resume text, optional job description, and that score breakdown to Google Gemini so Gemini can explain strengths, missing evidence, and priority improvements; Gemini cannot change the score. ApplyWise redacts common email addresses, phone numbers, and links before this request, but automated redaction may not catch every identifier. Google processes the submitted text under its applicable Gemini API terms and privacy notices, potentially in another country. Do not include confidential information or another person's private information.</p></div>
        <div><h2>Operator access</h2><p>A strongly authenticated operator may review account and workspace metadata when necessary to operate the service, answer a support or privacy request, investigate a security issue, or comply with law. ApplyWise does not permit silent routine browsing of resume contents, and does not use uploaded content for advertising.</p></div>
        <div><h2>Connected Google data</h2><p>If you voluntarily connect Google, ApplyWise uses Google sign-in details and, when separately authorized, read-only Gmail access to identify application-status messages. Protected tokens are retained until you disconnect or delete your account. Google data is not used for advertising.</p></div>
        <div><h2>Service providers</h2><p>The deployed service may use a hosting provider, managed SQL storage, private file storage, an email-delivery provider, Cloudflare Turnstile, and Google services that you expressly choose, including Google sign-in, Gmail import, and Gemini ATS feedback. These providers process information to deliver and protect the requested service.</p></div>
        <div><h2>Plan and payment records</h2><p>If you apply for Pro, ApplyWise stores the payment method, transaction reference, payer name, amount, notes, review status, and approval dates needed for manual verification and account administration. Do not enter card numbers, banking passwords, PINs, or one-time security codes. These records are visible to the strongly authenticated operator.</p></div>
        <div><h2>Retention and deletion</h2><p>Your workspace data is retained while your account remains open. Contact messages are retained only as needed to answer requests and operate the service. Operational product events are automatically removed after 90 days. Account deletion removes database records and queues private resume files for deletion, subject to limited backup-retention and legal obligations.</p></div>
        <div><h2>Your choices</h2><p>You can correct profile and workspace records, disconnect Google, or permanently delete your account from Settings. To request access to a copy of your information, ask why operator access was needed, or raise a privacy question, contact the address below.</p></div>
        <div><h2>Security and transfers</h2><p>ApplyWise uses account isolation, access controls, encrypted transport, rate limits, and protected credentials. No internet service can guarantee absolute security. Depending on provider locations, information may be processed outside your country.</p></div>
        <div><h2>Children</h2><p>ApplyWise is intended for people managing a professional job search and is not directed to children under 13. Do not submit another person's information unless you have permission.</p></div>
    </div>
    <p class="public-info-note">Privacy contact: <a href="mailto:awaisshaikhcs786@gmail.com">awaisshaikhcs786@gmail.com</a>. Material policy changes will be posted here with a revised date.</p>
</section>
